{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "assetName": "BunDau_after_table_click",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"IT’S HIM!\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The famous food critic!\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Can I get a picture?!\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Maybe later.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Welcome! We prepared our best table for you!\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Good. I dislike noisy areas.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Of course! Our chef personally prepared this Bún Đậu platter.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"As expected.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"A restaurant of this level should know how to welcome important guests.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Y-Yes…\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BunDau_after_visual_scan",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"The dip is the first thing that catches my eye.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That deep purple-brown color has a heavy fermented pull before I even taste it.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The foam on top looks strong too, almost too aggressive for the rest of the platter.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Visually, it promises depth, but also a sharp briny edge.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The tofu and toppings look clean enough, but the dip is clearly controlling the plate.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"So the first impression is powerful, maybe a little unbalanced.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BunDau_after_sound_scan",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"The tofu gives way softly when I press it.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"No dry crack, no rubbery bounce. The bite sounds gentle enough.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But the dip reacts differently.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"When it moves, the foam breaks with a thin, uneven sound.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That texture makes the sharper notes stand out more than they should.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The toppings are fine. The sauce is where the balance starts slipping.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BunDau_before_report",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Alright, I understand the platter now.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The dip has real depth, but it comes with a heavy briny punch.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The sharper lift after that feels louder than it needs to be.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The tofu itself is soft enough, so the base isn’t the problem.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The issue is how the sauce sits on everything.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It pushes too hard and makes the whole plate feel less controlled.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That should be enough for the report.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BunDau_after_correct_submit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"What do you think?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The toppings were decent.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The tofu was soft enough, and the fermented base had depth.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But the shrimp paste foam lacked consistency.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Consistency?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It feels too airy and uneven.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"And the flavor balance leans too heavily into that sharp tang.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I spent months refining that recipe…\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then perhaps spend a few more.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You wanted an honest review, didn’t you?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BunDau_after_wrong_submit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hm. That report doesn’t match the plate.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You think so?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The dip, the foam, and the tofu each give a different clue.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If you only judge the toppings, you miss what the sauce is doing.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Right. I should check the dip and texture again.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The answer is probably already in how it looks and breaks apart.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}